; p04_append.logo -- P0-4 TREATMENT sidecar for the rewrite-cost
; micro-measurement. At the close-think piece, appends ONE fixed sentence to
; the accumulated stream and closes the think block again: an append-only
; rewrite with a single SetStream and no retrieval, so the measured difference
; against p04_noop.logo isolates the SetStream rewrite machinery (KV rollback,
; re-encode, re-prefill) at a fixed, minimal insertion size.
; The close-think literal is built with the split-form concat trick because a
; whole-tag literal can be eaten by tooling.
; Pass-2 guard: after the rewrite the re-generated stream produces a second
; close-think piece; the stream then already contains a close tag and the
; piece is accepted instead of rewriting again.

Make "closetag" "</thi" _ "nk>" ; close-think tag via split-form concat
IfElse (:PIECE = :closetag) [ ; only act on the close-think piece
  Make "stream" GetStream ; grab accumulated stream
  IfElse IsNumber Search :closetag :stream [ ; already rewritten? accept
    PrintBanner "P04-APPEND: PASS 2 -> rewrite already applied, accept tag"
  ] [ ; append one fixed sentence and re-close
    Make "newstream" :stream _ "\nThe HX-340 is certified for 40 years of design life in continuous duty.\n" _ :closetag ; build appended stream
    PrintBanner "P04-APPEND: SetStream with fixed one-sentence append"
    SetStream :newstream ; trigger KV rollback + re-prefill
  ]
] []
